<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es-CL">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Aviva — Bienestar a tu manera</title>
<meta name="description" content="Una comunidad para mujeres que quieren sentirse mejor, sin exigencias y acompañadas.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;0,900;1,400;1,700&family=Didact+Gothic&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root {
  --olive: #B1A741;
  --olive-dark: #8A8232;
  --yellow: #F3E000;
  --yellow-light: #FFF9CC;
  --wine: #A22349;
  --wine-dark: #7a1a37;
  --wine-light: #c94d6e;
  --bg: #FAF8F0;
  --bg-alt: #F3EFE3;
  --dark: #1A1715;
  --dark-alt: #252220;
  --text: #1A1715;
  --text-light: #5A564D;
  --text-muted: #8A8578;
  --text-on-dark: #FAF8F0;
  --fd: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  --fb: Georgia, serif;
  --fl: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
  --e: cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
}
*,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;overflow-x:hidden}
body{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg);overflow-x:hidden}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
button{cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--fl)}

/* ═══════ PROGRESS ═══════ */
.progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:0%;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--olive),var(--yellow),var(--wine));z-index:9999}

/* ═══════ NAV ═══════ */
.nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;z-index:1000;padding:1.1rem 3rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;transition:all .5s var(--e)}
.nav.scrolled{background:rgba(250,248,240,.95);backdrop-filter:blur(20px);padding:.7rem 3rem;box-shadow:0 1px 30px rgba(26,23,21,.06)}
.nav__logo{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--wine);letter-spacing:.01em}
.nav__links{display:flex;gap:2rem;list-style:none}
.nav__links a{font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-light);transition:color .3s;position:relative}
.nav__links a::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-4px;left:0;width:0;height:2px;background:var(--wine);transition:width .4s var(--e)}
.nav__links a:hover{color:var(--wine)}
.nav__links a:hover::after{width:100%}
.hamburger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:none;border:none;padding:4px;z-index:1001}
.hamburger span{display:block;width:24px;height:1.5px;background:var(--text);transition:all .3s}
.hamburger.active span:nth-child(1){transform:rotate(45deg) translate(4px,4px)}
.hamburger.active span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
.hamburger.active span:nth-child(3){transform:rotate(-45deg) translate(5px,-5px)}
.mob-menu{display:none;position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100vh;background:var(--bg);z-index:999;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:2.5rem}
.mob-menu.active{display:flex}
.mob-menu a{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:2rem;color:var(--wine)}

/* ═══════ HERO ═══════ */
.hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:6rem 2rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:var(--olive)}
.hero__v{position:absolute;right:-6%;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-family:var(--fd);font-size:clamp(28rem,50vw,60rem);font-weight:900;color:var(--wine);opacity:.15;line-height:.75;pointer-events:none;user-select:none}
.hero__content{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:700px}
.hero__logo{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:clamp(4.5rem,13vw,10rem);font-weight:900;line-height:.85;color:var(--wine);margin-bottom:1.5rem;opacity:0}
.hero__tagline{font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--yellow);margin-bottom:2rem;opacity:0}
.hero__text{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:clamp(.95rem,1.8vw,1.15rem);color:var(--bg);max-width:500px;margin:0 auto 3rem;line-height:1.8;opacity:0}
.hero__btn{display:inline-block;padding:1rem 3.5rem;background:var(--wine);color:white;border-radius:9999px;font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;border:2px solid var(--wine);transition:all .4s var(--e);opacity:0}
.hero__btn:hover{background:transparent;color:var(--wine)}
.hero__scroll{position:absolute;bottom:2rem;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;opacity:0;z-index:2}
.hero__scroll span{font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--yellow)}
.hero__scroll-line{width:1px;height:35px;background:var(--yellow);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero__scroll-line::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:-100%;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:var(--wine);animation:sd 2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes sd{0%{top:-100%}50%{top:100%}100%{top:100%}}

/* ═══════ SECTIONS ═══════ */
section{padding:7rem 2rem;position:relative}
.inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}
.ey{font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.63rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:.8rem}
.st{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,3.5rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:1rem}
.st em{font-style:italic;color:var(--wine)}
.section-text{font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.8;max-width:700px}
.section-text.center{text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}

/* ═══════ BRAND STATEMENT ═══════ */
.brand{background:var(--wine);color:var(--text-on-dark);display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:auto;padding:7rem 2rem}
.brand .inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5rem;align-items:center}
.brand .st{color:var(--bg);font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem)}
.brand .st em{color:var(--yellow)}
.brand__text{font-size:1rem;color:rgba(250,248,240,.8);line-height:1.9}
.brand__accent{width:60px;height:3px;background:var(--yellow);margin-bottom:2rem}

/* ═══════ ABOUT ═══════ */
.about{background:var(--bg)}
.about__header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:5rem}
.about__mv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem;margin-top:4rem}
.mv-card{background:var(--bg-alt);border-radius:20px;padding:2.5rem;border-left:4px solid var(--wine)}
.mv-card h3{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem}
.mv-card p{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.7}
.founders{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2rem;margin-top:4rem}
.founder{text-align:center;padding:2.5rem 1.5rem}
.founder__photo{width:140px;height:140px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;background:var(--bg-alt);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--fd);font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:900;color:white;border:3px solid var(--wine);overflow:hidden}
.founder:nth-child(1) .founder__photo{background:var(--wine)}
.founder:nth-child(2) .founder__photo{background:var(--olive)}
.founder:nth-child(3) .founder__photo{background:var(--wine-dark)}
.founder__name{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.2rem}
.founder__role{font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--wine);margin-bottom:.8rem}
.founder__desc{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.7}

/* ═══════ COMMUNITY ═══════ */
.community{background:var(--yellow-light)}
.community__header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:2rem}
.community__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2rem;margin-top:4rem}
.comm-card{background:var(--bg);border-radius:20px;padding:2.5rem;border:1px solid rgba(26,23,21,.06);transition:all .4s var(--e)}
.comm-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(26,23,21,.06);border-color:var(--olive)}
.comm-card__num{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--wine);margin-bottom:.5rem}
.comm-card__title{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.8rem}
.comm-card__desc{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.7}

/* ═══════ SERVICES ═══════ */
.services{background:var(--bg)}
.services__header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:5rem}
.services__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:2rem}
.service{border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid rgba(26,23,21,.06);transition:all .4s var(--e)}
.service:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(26,23,21,.06)}
.service__img{height:220px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--fd);font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;color:white}
.service:nth-child(1) .service__img{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--olive),var(--olive-dark))}
.service:nth-child(2) .service__img{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--wine),var(--wine-dark))}
.service:nth-child(3) .service__img{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--wine-light),var(--wine))}
.service:nth-child(4) .service__img{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--olive),var(--wine))}
.service__body{padding:2rem}
.service__title{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.5rem}
.service__desc{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.7}

/* ═══════ EVENTS ═══════ */
.events{background:var(--yellow-light)}
.events__header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:5rem}
.events__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2rem}
.event{background:var(--bg);border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(26,23,21,.06);transition:all .4s var(--e);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.event:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(26,23,21,.08)}
.event__img{height:180px;background:var(--bg-alt);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-muted);font-style:italic}
.event__body{padding:2rem;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.event__date{font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.63rem;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--wine);margin-bottom:.5rem}
.event__title{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.5rem}
.event__desc{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.5rem;flex:1}
.event__btn{display:inline-block;text-align:center;padding:.8rem 2rem;background:var(--wine);color:white;border-radius:9999px;font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:all .3s;border:2px solid var(--wine);align-self:flex-start}
.event__btn:hover{background:transparent;color:var(--wine)}

/* ═══════ TESTIMONIALS ═══════ */
.testimonials{background:var(--bg)}
.testimonials__header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:5rem}
.testimonials__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2rem;margin-bottom:4rem}
.testimonial{background:var(--bg-alt);border-radius:20px;padding:2.5rem;position:relative}
.testimonial::before{content:'"';font-family:var(--fd);font-size:4rem;color:var(--wine);opacity:.3;position:absolute;top:.5rem;left:1.5rem;line-height:1}
.testimonial__text{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.7;font-style:italic;margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-top:1.5rem}
.testimonial__author{font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--wine)}
.community-photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:.5rem;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden}
.community-photos__item{aspect-ratio:1;background:var(--bg-alt);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);font-style:italic;transition:transform .3s}
.community-photos__item:hover{transform:scale(1.05)}

/* ═══════ BENEFITS / PARTNERS ═══════ */
.benefits{background:var(--olive);color:var(--text-on-dark);overflow:hidden}
.benefits__header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:4rem}
.benefits__header .st{color:var(--bg)}
.benefits__header .st em{color:var(--wine)}
.benefits__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2rem;margin-bottom:5rem}
.benefit{text-align:center;padding:2rem}
.benefit__icon{font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--wine)}
.benefit__title{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--bg);margin-bottom:.5rem}
.benefit__desc{font-size:.85rem;color:rgba(250,248,240,.7);line-height:1.7}
.partners{padding-top:3rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,248,240,.15)}
.partners__label{text-align:center;font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.63rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(250,248,240,.5);margin-bottom:2rem}
.partners__track{display:flex;gap:4rem;animation:scroll-partners 20s linear infinite;width:max-content}
.partners__logo{font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.9rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(250,248,240,.35);white-space:nowrap;padding:1rem 0}
@keyframes scroll-partners{0%{transform:translateX(0)}100%{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

/* ═══════ PODCAST ═══════ */
.podcast{background:var(--wine);color:var(--text-on-dark);text-align:center}
.podcast__inner{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
.podcast__photo{width:100%;max-width:500px;height:280px;background:var(--wine-dark);border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:3rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1rem;color:rgba(250,248,240,.4);font-style:italic}
.podcast__title{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:700;color:var(--bg);margin-bottom:1rem}
.podcast__text{font-size:1rem;color:rgba(250,248,240,.7);margin-bottom:2rem;max-width:500px}
.podcast__btn{display:inline-block;padding:1rem 3rem;background:var(--yellow);color:var(--dark);border-radius:9999px;font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:all .3s;border:2px solid var(--yellow)}
.podcast__btn:hover{background:transparent;color:var(--yellow)}

/* ═══════ CONTACT / FOOTER ═══════ */
.footer{background:var(--olive);color:rgba(250,248,240,.7);padding:4rem 2rem;text-align:center}
.footer__logo{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--wine);margin-bottom:.5rem}
.footer__tl{font-style:italic;font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:2rem;color:var(--bg)}
.footer__social{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:2rem;margin-bottom:2rem}
.footer__social a{font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(250,248,240,.6);transition:color .3s}
.footer__social a:hover{color:var(--bg)}
.footer__copy{font-size:.65rem;color:rgba(250,248,240,.3)}
.footer__contact{margin-bottom:2rem}
.footer__contact a{color:var(--bg);font-family:var(--fl);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.05em;transition:color .3s}
.footer__contact a:hover{color:var(--wine)}

/* ═══════ RESPONSIVE ═══════ */
@media(max-width:1024px){.brand .inner{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:768px){
  .nav__links{display:none}.hamburger{display:flex}
  .founders,.community__grid,.services__grid,.events__grid,.testimonials__grid,.benefits__grid,.about__mv{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .community-photos{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  section{padding:4rem 1rem}
  .hero__v{font-size:18rem;right:-20%}
  .nav{padding:1rem 1.5rem}.nav.scrolled{padding:.7rem 1.5rem}
  .brand .inner{gap:3rem}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="progress"></div>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav class="nav">
  <a href="#" class="nav__logo">aviva</a>
  <ul class="nav__links">
    <li><a href="#nosotras">Nosotras</a></li>
    <li><a href="#comunidad">Comunidad</a></li>
    <li><a href="#experiencias">Experiencias</a></li>
    <li><a href="#podcast">Podcast</a></li>
    <li><a href="#beneficios">Beneficios</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contacto">Contacto</a></li>
  </ul>
  <button class="hamburger" aria-label="Menú"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
</nav>
<div class="mob-menu">
  <a href="#nosotras">Nosotras</a>
  <a href="#comunidad">Comunidad</a>
  <a href="#experiencias">Experiencias</a>
  <a href="#podcast">Podcast</a>
  <a href="#beneficios">Beneficios</a>
  <a href="#contacto">Contacto</a>
</div>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__v">V</div>
  <div class="hero__content">
    <h1 class="hero__logo">aviva</h1>
    <p class="hero__tagline">Bienestar a tu manera</p>
    <p class="hero__text">Una comunidad para mujeres que quieren sentirse mejor, sin exigencias y acompañadas.</p>
    <a href="#comunidad" class="hero__btn">Unirme</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__scroll"><span>Descubre</span><div class="hero__scroll-line"></div></div>
</section>

<!-- BRAND STATEMENT -->
<section class="brand">
  <div class="inner">
    <div>
      <div class="brand__accent"></div>
      <h2 class="st">Por qué existe <em>Aviva</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="brand__text">AVIVA nació de tres mujeres distintas que, desde caminos muy diferentes, sintieron la misma necesidad: crear el espacio que a ellas les hubiera gustado encontrar antes.</p>
      <br>
      <p class="brand__text">Entre la exigencia, la desconexión, la presión por poder con todo y la sensación de tener que hacerlo solas, entendieron que muchas mujeres están cansadas de buscar versiones perfectas de sí mismas y solo necesitan un lugar donde puedan sentirse acompañadas, vistas y reales.</p>
      <br>
      <p class="brand__text">Desde el bienestar, el diseño, las experiencias, el movimiento, la sensibilidad y el crecimiento personal, decidieron crear una comunidad más humana que perfecta; un espacio donde el bienestar no tiene una sola forma y donde cada una puede construir la suya sin presión ni culpa.</p>
      <br>
      <p class="brand__text">AVIVA significa volver a encenderte: sentirte viva, presente y conectada contigo misma, pero también con otras mujeres que están aprendiendo, creciendo y sosteniéndose juntas.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- NOSOTRAS -->
<section class="about" id="nosotras">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="about__header">
      <p class="ey">Quiénes somos</p>
      <h2 class="st">Tres miradas, un solo <em>movimiento</em></h2>
      <p class="section-text center" style="margin-top:1rem">No somos gurús. Somos tres mujeres distintas, en proceso, reales. Y eso es exactamente lo que queremos construir.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="founders">
      <div class="founder">
        <div class="founder__photo">A</div>
        <h3 class="founder__name">Antonella Cartoni</h3>
        <p class="founder__role">Visionaria Legal + Bienestar</p>
        <p class="founder__desc">Abogada con una comunidad de moda y bienestar. Cree que el bienestar no se ve de una sola forma y que cada mujer lo vive a su manera.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="founder">
        <div class="founder__photo">R</div>
        <h3 class="founder__name">Rafaela Vieira</h3>
        <p class="founder__role">Coach + Líder de Experiencias</p>
        <p class="founder__desc">Coach con 5 años de experiencia en eventos y viajes para mujeres. Cree que ya tienes todo lo que necesitas — solo falta un espacio seguro para verlo.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="founder">
        <div class="founder__photo">S</div>
        <h3 class="founder__name">Sofía Cavallini</h3>
        <p class="founder__role">Creativa + Emprendedora</p>
        <p class="founder__desc">Diseñadora y emprendedora de larga trayectoria. Comunidad de deporte y desarrollo personal. Cree que cuidarte también es una decisión.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about__mv">
      <div class="mv-card">
        <h3>Misión</h3>
        <p>Crear espacios, experiencias, productos y herramientas que sostengan a las mujeres en su poder y sensibilidad, que eleven su consciencia y les permitan vivir en bienestar y seguras de sí mismas.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mv-card">
        <h3>Visión</h3>
        <p>Ser un movimiento de miles de mujeres en Latinoamérica que eligieron una vida auténtica, donde cada una construye su propia versión de bienestar acompañada por una comunidad real y comprometida.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- COMUNIDAD -->
<section class="community" id="comunidad">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="community__header">
      <p class="ey">Comunidad</p>
